silm:instances_papers_11_base_commutative_diagram_chapters_24_rosetta_stone_cross_domain_sections_02_music_archivist_entry_point_concrete_anchor_1#soundsource silm:hasLongDescription "The SoundSource is the raw audio class: any recording that could be the Mittens piano-theme -- specifically a 24-bit WAV file from the 2026-03-15 Studio-B session. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'SoundSource', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
